# Nothing generated, local or secret goes into the build context: the image is built from the committed sources.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.turbo
.stack-data
# Rust build output (gigabytes) stays out. The contract sources and `contracts/templates/release.json` stay in: the web build imports that
# file. The template .wasm files are built apart and found through REWARDS_TEMPLATES_DIR (docs/operations/deployment.md).
**/target
tests/e2e/screenshots
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
apps/web/public/play
apps/web/public/scenes
